text":"たらふく食べました♪♪v_v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、\nこの3日間でデブ決定！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったら体重は減ってたオチ。\n人間の身体ってわからんね(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は地元に帰りたかったなぁ...\nでも平日に帰っても友達はみんな\n仕事とか学校だから(´･ｪ･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n連休はまたしばらくないだろう。\nお仕事頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春夏はおしゃれが楽しみ♪\nそして髪伸びた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/05/17/7449143/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はボムの撮影だったよ！\n楽しかった(*∩ω∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝日新聞の企画も最近沢山^_^\n脳が腐ってきてるから\n頭使わないとね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日も明日も明後日も\n頑張ります〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/05/17/7449143/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっ(^o^)/"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9595":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたがー、\nあけまして おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーいぶ元気になった＼(^^)／よかたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は寝正月極めたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月といえばショッピング！とかゆ\nあたしの常識を覆してやったぜー"},{"type":"break"},{"typ